# Org hub authoring

Standing repo law: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

## Brochure only

- Do not vendor `course/` from sibling repos.
- Link live course Pages: `/a1-inventor/`, `/almost-open/`.
- Gate demo: redirect to course Pages; do not resurrect a full local gate demo here.

## Home workshops list

- Nav: Workshops → `#workshops` only (no per-workshop tabs).
- Section heading: Workshops — no “Two paths” / monorepo prompt copy.
- Card titles: **AI Driven Invention**, **How To Make (almost) Anything**.

## Inventor brochure (`/inventor/`)

- Brand as **AI Driven Invention**. Use **weeks** language (15-week spine). Do not restore Track A/B/C ladder copy.
- Nav: Workshops + Course (+ Weeks / Gate) — not a lone Inventor tab.
- CTAs point at the live course weeks index / week 1 and the course gate demo.

## Visual

- Keep the light course-site token set (teal accent, reading-first type).
- One job per section; avoid dashboard clutter on the home and brochure pages.
